  "id": "sojourns-in-slumberland",
  "title": "Sojourns in Slumberland",
  "subtitle": "An original audio mystery by Fred Azeredo",
  "description": "CKUT invites you to ENTER THE UNREAL. The scene: Aurora, Texas, 1934. Young Lotte Lerman lives a shadow-life, halfway between reality and dream. But this spell is soon broken by a terrifying encounter with a being from another world, which sends her on a journey through a nightmare of the American Heartland, searching for the one thing she can't bear to live without. On the way she'll run into flying saucers, ghostly killers, talking mongeese, and even stranger things that lie beyond the pale of waking life. Will she make it through in one piece? Who will join her on her solitary path? And what dark revelation waits at the end of the railroad tracks? Only one way to find out... Welcome to SOJOURNS IN SLUMBERLAND, from the people who brought you the hit SOJOURNS IN SPACE. Every episode is written and directed by Fred Azeredo, featuring a variety of guest stars and the core cast: Dana Prather, Alice Wu, Zoe Heffring, Carmen Mancuso, and Fred Azeredo.",
